@dc:title "Phenotyping description bundle"
@dc:description "Pulls in the vocabulary bundle + all descriptions so reasoning sees everything at once."
description bundle <http://www.example.com/phenotype/description/bundle#> as d-bundle {
    uses <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> as dc
    uses <http://www.example.com/phenotype/vocabulary-bundle#>
    includes <http://www.example.com/phenotype/description/data#>
    includes <http://www.example.com/phenotype/description/terminology#>
    includes <http://www.example.com/phenotype/description/definition#>
    includes <http://www.example.com/phenotype/description/cohort#>
}
